Unit 2: User Interface design
3.1 Graphical and web user interfaces

Best Free Figma Plugins
=======================
1. Iconify

Best for:
SVG icons
UI icons
Navigation icons

Features:
Huge icon library
Material Icons
Font Awesome
Heroicons
SVG support

Widely recommended as one of the best free icon plugins.

Iconify Plugins:
https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/735098390272716381
https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/735098390272716381


Recommended Plugin Setup for Beginners
======================================
Purpose	                  Plugin
=======                   ======
Icons	                    Iconify
Images	                  Unsplash
UX                        Flow	Autoflow
Placeholder Content	      Content Reel
Charts	                  Chart
Background Removal	      Remove BG
File Cleanup	            Similayer

How to Install Plugins
======================
- Inside Figma
- Open a file
- Right-click canvas
- Plugins → Manage Plugins
- Search plugin name
- Click Install

Where to Find Plugins
=====================
Figma Community Plugins

